Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 04:05:07 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 62/97] cudagraph: capture prefill kernels for mixed FULL
 graphs (port of upstream #58275)

Port of the upstream vLLM change #58275 (Apache-2.0). Mixed prefill/decode batches under FULL CUDA graphs capture the prefill kernels
they run.
